# rtl-433@868: European ISM band.
#
# Field note (2026-09-22): the default decoder set finds NOTHING here on this
# node, twice over 15 minutes each - yet the band is busy. The traffic is
# 2-FSK on 868.10/868.50 that none of rtl_433's 269 protocols decode; see
# docs/sdr-tools.md. Keep this profile for the wM-Bus decoders below, but do
# not read its silence as an empty band.
#
# 104 = wM-Bus Mode C&T, which wants -s 1200k for its 100 kbps signalling;
# modes S and T (105, 238) live on 868.3 and need their own profile.
RTL433_ARGS=-f 868.95M -s 1200k -R 104 -M level -M time:iso -F json
